'''Lorrdians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Humanoid|bipedal]] [[species]] that gave off a distinctive natural scent and had a very expressive [[Language|body language]]. Lorrdian members of the [[Brotherhood of the Beatific Countenance]] wore concealing [[Clothing|robes]] that acted as a physical vow of silence.<ref name="Visual Guide" />

[[Rabé Tonsort|Rabé]], a [[Naboo Royal Handmaidens|handmaiden]] of [[Queen]] [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]], was considered an expert in reading body language thanks to training from Lorrdians.<ref name="Queen's Shadow">''[[Queen's Shadow]]''</ref>

